# docs/20 B2 regression (U1, U6, U8, U15, U23; D3, D8). Before: nothing showed for the
# first 500 ms of a G0 hold; the 5 minute memo cap came without warning; the meeting page
# had lost the battery; the boxes' hint bar repeated their key line; the meeting hint
# did not say Space stars. Now: "● Wait" in the status bar from the press; from 4:30
# "0:30 left" in Warn and a Warn waveform; "Bat N%" on the meeting page (yellow under 30 %);
# under 30 % the start box says about how long the battery lasts; the boxes' hint names
# Opt+L; the meeting hint is [G0]/[Space]star.
boot store=sd usb=on bat=4100 lang=zh
include ../common/demo_state.cpas
wait 1500
down g0
wait 100
shot ready  G0 down 100 ms: ● Wait in the status bar, still home
wait 500
mic 269000 2500
shot memo-4m28  4:28: Part 1, the waveform Accent
mic 2000 2500
shot memo-4m30  4:30: 0:30 left in Warn, the waveform Warn
mic 30000 2500
shot memo-cap  5:01, still held: the cap card, Let go of [G0]
up g0
wait 3000
usb off
bat 3500
wait 4000
press opt+r
wait 600
shot start-box  the start box at 23%: Battery: about 25 min; the hint names Opt+L, not Enter again
press enter
mic 3000 speech
wait 3000
shot meeting  the meeting: Bat 23% in yellow on the timer row; hint [G0]/[Space]star
press opt+r
wait 600
shot end-box  the end box: the hint names Opt+L (keep going, lock)
press `
wait 300
press opt+r
wait 600
press enter
wait 3000
shot ended  ended: back home
